WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.275 line:78% position:50% align:center
Earth is huge.
12,742 kilometers across.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.275 line:78% position:50% align:center
But Jupiter is nearly
eleven Earths wide.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.300 line:78% position:50% align:center
Our Sun is almost
ten Jupiters across.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.325 line:78% position:50% align:center
Rigel is about fifty times
the Sun's radius.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.050 line:78% position:50% align:center
And Betelgeuse? An estimated 724 times
the Sun's radius.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.125 line:78% position:50% align:center
And that's just one star.
